Simply360 Reference App — File Provider Gateway (simply360-reference-file-provider)
Copyright 2026 Solve It Simply, Inc.

This product includes software developed at Solve It Simply, Inc.
(https://www.simply360.app).

This repository is a public reference proof: a separately packaged,
MinIO-backed gateway that implements the signed public primary-file-provider
protocol out of process. It uses only public Simply360 platform boundaries and
operates exclusively on disposable synthetic proof objects — never customer
data. It contains no Simply360 internal database models, worker imports,
provider secrets, or authorization logic.

